WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.860
- [Narrator] This is
the dictator scorpion.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.040
Growing up to eight inches in length,

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.620
it is one of the largest
scorpions in the world.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.300
For its colossal size,
the dictator scorpion

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.380
has relatively weak venom, so for defense

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.840
it resorts to its enormous claws.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.010
They help it to catch prey and ward off

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.180
other scorpions.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.030
Located within the region of West Africa,

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.190
the dictator scorpion is nocturnal,

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.530
spending most of its life underground,

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.860
sometimes burrowing as deep as six feet.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.580
Unfortunately, size doesn't
matter when it comes

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.180
to the preservation of
the dictator scorpion.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.270
With their natural
habitats being destroyed

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:43.030
by deforestation, its future is uncertain.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:45.040
This is the dictator scorpion.

